<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Pravir Chandra Bhanj Deo</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1929">1929</a>–<a href="/years/1966">1966</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Pravir Chandra Bhanj Deo was the last ruling <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/maharaja">Maharaja</a> of Bastar, installed as a child in 1936. After the state merged into <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/india">India</a> in 1948 he became a champion of the Adivasi peoples of Bastar in disputes over land and forests with the government. He was killed in a police firing at his palace in Jagdalpur in 1966.</p></div>
